{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19121","headline":"酬朗州崔员外与任十四兄侍御同过鄙人旧居见怀之什时守吴郡 · 刘禹锡","name":"酬朗州崔员外与任十四兄侍御同过鄙人旧居见怀之什时守吴郡","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"昔日居邻招屈亭，枫林橘树鹧鸪声。\n一辞御苑青门去，十见蛮江白芷生。\n自此曾沾宣室召，如今又守阖闾城。\n何人万里能相忆，同舍仙郎与外兄。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19121.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19121","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}